      "sourceTextSha256": "81b1ba68e708e384d729c60fe62fe30566f7a212b25cd6b0ee4591d8b0b79b1c",
      "text": "Seventeen days from Santiago and the vineyards of central Chile to the moai of Easter Island, the Atacama Desert, Patagonian glaciers and Mendoza’s wineries. Visits to both sides of Iguazu Falls and tango in Buenos Aires complete the journey. Hotels include specified room categories; private aviation is quoted separately.",
