      "sourceTextSha256": "00e4fb4d8181f3400ff0ccd5a15b0e4849fca41618ace99a1330ed41735c7717",
      "text": "From USD 23,700 per person, based on double occupancy.\n\nThe price shown includes hotel accommodation and all ground services/excursions in the program. Private jet flights between regions are not included and are calculated separately, on request, depending on the dates selected.",
